    "name": "What Affects the Cost of a Bedroom Addition in San Diego?",
    "text": "What Affects the Cost of a Bedroom Addition in San Diego?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "The cost of a bedroom addition depends on the size and shape of the new space, foundation and framing requirements, roof connections, windows and doors, insulation, electrical work, finishes, and any added bathroom or plumbing. Permit and design requirements, existing site conditions, and the extent of work needed to connect the addition to the home also affect the estimate.",
